        "note": "dist-no-fonts is used (not dist-cdn-fonts/dist) so the vendored static UI never references a runtime font CDN. Verified empirically against the pinned Mihomo v1.19.30 binary: Mihomo requires an external-ui directory to be a subpath of its own home directory or listed in the SAFE_PATHS environment variable of the process that spawns it, and otherwise attempts a live download of a dashboard from the internet -- this package must always stage this directory and set SAFE_PATHS before launching Mihomo. indexHtmlSha256 pins the exact unpatched upstream index.html the packaging scripts know how to CSP-patch; a future re-vendor must review and re-pin it deliberately."
